  "notes": "- Add `/swarm <task>` on the start page and in chat. Aix coordinates its own workers: each has a separate conversation, can wait for an addressed board post, and can take follow-up work without repeating its first assignment. No Antigravity service is involved in orchestration.\n- Inspect workers in the Office or use `/swarm status` for the latest roster and board. A run allows four concurrent workers and twelve assignments, stays under the session's normal tool approvals, and stops the team on Esc. Reopening a session does not replay interrupted work.\n- Let job events drive the desktop working indicator so a fast slash-command completion cannot leave it stuck. The shared swarm engine also ships in aix v2.28.0.",
